---
import SiteShell from '../layouts/SiteShell.astro'
import Container from '../components/site/Container.astro'
import Callout from '../components/site/Callout.astro'
---

<SiteShell title="About" description="About DC2SC">
  
  <div class="dc-page-hero">
    <Container>
      <h1 class="dc-page-hero__headline">About DC2SC</h1>
      <p class="dc-page-hero__body">
        DC2SC is an independent research program studying how independent people may form voluntary, intelligible and participant-contestable collective market positions.
      </p>
    </Container>
  </div>

  <Container class="dc-prose" style="max-width: 800px; padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 6rem;">
    
    <h2>What DC2SC is</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>An independent research program</li>
      <li>Focused on buyer-side market formation</li>
      <li>Studying whether voluntary collective market positions are possible—and where they fail</li>
      <li>Operating with explicit scope boundaries and evidence standards</li>
      <li>Using GOLIAF as a bounded travel stress-test environment</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What DC2SC is not</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Not a promise of discounts</li>
      <li>Not a live booking service</li>
      <li>Not a demand-generation funnel</li>
      <li>Not a claim of field validation</li>
      <li>Not an invitation to a pool, waitlist or membership</li>
      <li>Not a startup or commercial product</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Research posture</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>DC2SC does not assume aggregation is beneficial</li>
      <li>DC2SC does not assume transactions indicate success</li>
      <li>DC2SC tracks failure explicitly</li>
      <li>A null result is a valid research outcome</li>
      <li>'Do not aggregate' is a valid research conclusion</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Evidence discipline</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>E0 Conceptual:</strong> logical/theoretical, no field data</li>
      <li><strong>E1 Exploratory:</strong> preliminary, not validated</li>
      <li><strong>E2 Observational:</strong> structured with controls</li>
      <li><strong>E3 Validated:</strong> replicated</li>
    </ul>
    <p><em>All current research: E0</em></p>

    <h2>GOLIAF boundary</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>GOLIAF is a research environment, not a product</li>
      <li>Travel is used as a stress-test, not a service</li>
      <li>No live market, no live inventory, no live bookings</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Open questions</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><em>Can participants form intelligible collective positions without prior social coordination?</em></li>
      <li><em>What level of constraint heterogeneity makes collective positions impossible?</em></li>
      <li><em>When does collective ratification collapse into manufactured consensus?</em></li>
      <li><em>How should 'do not aggregate' be recorded and reported as an outcome?</em></li>
    </ul>

    <div style="margin-top: 4rem;">
      <Callout type="boundary">
        Prototype disclosure: This is a Phase 1 prototype. No user data is collected. No third-party services are active. No live market claims are made.
      </Callout>
    </div>

  </Container>

</SiteShell>
